        "type": "rich",
        "title": "Island_of_Variation",
        "color": 16430178,
        "author": {
          "name": "Madd"
        },
        "footer": {
          "text": "It was supposed to be a simple Dirium production gig, you know set up some drills, some crucibles, and maybe some defenses to discourage thieves, but things turned sour. Half of the crew left when they heard the turrets we were being authorized to use and the discovery of the ruined bunkers drove off most the rest of us, I should have followed them but I was too stubborn. All we have are a few stone drills and some basic turrets, I hope we can survive long enough to get paid. I hear them coming . . ."
        },
